{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43286","headline":"琢玉 · 丁居晦","name":"琢玉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卞玉何时献，初疑尚在荆。\n琢来闻制器，价衒胜连城。\n虹气冲天白，云浮入信贞。\n佩爲廉节德，杯作侈奢名。\n露璞方期辨，雕文幸既成。\n他山岂无石，宁及此时呈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丁居晦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}